


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_ab0444d5:



    voice "d/2HI_1479"
    hina "「跳累了吗？已经没力气做了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_c7358588:


    "伦坐在椅子上，终于喘过气来；跨坐在伦膝盖上的阳菜抬着头，不安地看着她。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_fbc0125e:



    voice "d/2RI_1483"
    rin "「你这是什么表情」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_f78692f3:



    voice "d/2HI_1480"
    hina "「因为……我怕你又说下次再做」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_20f51d55:


    "伦轻抚阳菜的脸颊，面带平静的笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_1faeb51e:



    voice "d/2RI_1484"
    rin "「那个和这个是两码事」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_efca882c:



    voice "d/2HI_1481"
    hina "「诶嘿嘿～♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_b9be471c:


    "阳菜立刻开心起来。而她的开心也立刻在脸上流露出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_e90b7f94:



    voice "d/2RI_1485"
    rin "「噗，你这是什么表情」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_5ea20d88:


    "阳菜多变的表情让伦忍俊不禁。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_d2969e73:



    voice "d/2RI_1486"
    rin "「在阳菜说“够了，饶了我吧”之前我会一直做的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_dcbfe887:



    voice "d/2HI_1482"
    hina "「不会说的。我想一直做下去」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_ecbe2add:



    voice "d/2RI_1487"
    rin "「………也是」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_b8317fbc:


    "阳菜的体力是无穷尽的。不难想象伦会先认输求饶。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_6ee032d0:



    voice "d/2HI_1483"
    hina "「伦你悠着点别累到了啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_d15a4ff4:


    "啊，被她发现了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_2d7efc81:



    voice "d/2RI_1488"
    rin "「才、才没有累呢！今晚不会让你睡的～！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_071add35:



    voice "d/2HI_1484"
    hina "「这才傍晚吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_10_d_afa3c25d:


    "干劲十足，但没届到。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c8696499:


    "阳菜的衣服已经被扒开了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a5a43ef5:


    "上身自是不用说，下身的内裤也只是挂在了一条腿的膝盖上。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_4518dc60:


    "以前她对只有自己脱衣服有所抵触，但现在已经老老实实服从了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_31e6ad46:



    voice "d/2RI_1489"
    rin "「不冷……吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_3748b879:


    "阳菜点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_fefa366f:


    "虽说她们直到刚才还一直在运动着身体，但空调效果也很强。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_e20476e1:


    "教堂只有两个人的情况下还开满空调，是有些奢侈。但这回就通融一下吧？"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_6c908c87:



    voice "d/2RI_1490"
    rin "「在教堂做有种背德感。有点兴奋」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_816b07c5:


    "伦四下张望，缩了缩脖子。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a510cd3e:



    voice "d/2HI_1485"
    hina "「背德……感？我不懂那是什么」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_168a1df0:



    voice "d/2RI_1491"
    rin "「阳菜不需要懂啦。总之就是我很兴奋很激动」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_97aefc96:



    voice "d/2HI_1486"
    hina "「伦在兴奋的话，我也会兴奋」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_05bbecb5:



    voice "d/2RI_1492"
    rin "「哇，缩紧了一下」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_6b5b4abc:


    "抚摸着阳菜私处的伦感觉到了它的变化。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_ab3f65f0:



    voice "d/2RI_1493"
    rin "「呜啊，为什么你这么可爱啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_be61d2e5:


    "名为阳菜的宝物？"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_6c8796fe:



    voice "d/2RI_1494"
    rin "「对我这样的废柴主人来说，你果然是太过奢侈的狗狗（恋人）啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c5471f09:


    "伦苦笑道。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_b6d42577:



    voice "d/2RI_1495"
    rin "「不公平啊……只有我一味索取。阳菜明明一直在给我闪闪发光的喜欢之情，而我……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_ed43e5a0:



    voice "d/2HI_1487"
    hina "「那个，虽然伦说自己是一味索取，但其实我也收获了很多哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_75989b1e:


    "阳菜那追随伦的视线闪烁着无比的光芒，但伦并没有注意到。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_600c0c32:


    "那正是因为……{w}伦是个废柴主人。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_030865e8:



    voice "d/2HI_1488"
    hina "「啊，不过你要是愿意给的话，我会全盘收下的♪」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a0c6c301:



    voice "d/2RI_1496"
    rin "「——阳菜」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a8a97e38:



    voice "d/2HI_1489"
    hina "「啊，还有不要再自卑了，作为喜欢你的人我会很伤心的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_7f5a2260:



    voice "d/2RI_1497"
    rin "「啊……好的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_24739663:


    "又立刻被说教。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_9be8fc18:



    voice "d/2HI_1490"
    hina "「我会努力争取伦的宠爱的，所以不要丢下我好吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_bb984b11:


    "她哪舍得丢下你啊！"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_5871f5c4:



    voice "d/2RI_1498"
    rin "「我、我也会更加疼爱你的，所以不要丢下我！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_67aaa788:


    "你在说啥？"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_5a90a538:



    voice "d/2HI_1491"
    hina "「但伦在H的时候总是很温柔呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_2ca169fd:



    voice "d/2RI_1499"
    rin "「哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_703d4053:


    "伦又用接吻蒙混过关；但体贴的阳菜闭上了眼。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_690feab9:



    voice "d/2HI_1492"
    hina "「亲……伦……呼哈」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_3d76d0a5:



    voice "d/2RI_1500"
    rin "「嗯……亲」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_56651773:


    "连接在两人舌间的唾液，在窗外夕阳的映照下闪着银光。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_990588a1:


    "接吻无关主从，只是互相感受、互相索求。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_201808d4:


    "发情将舞蹈带来的疲劳一扫而空。也不知她们的唾液对对方来说是媚药还是圣药。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_6322077a:



    voice "d/2HI_1493"
    hina "「唔……嗯嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_aecaf890:


    "阳菜笨拙的舌头，努力追上伦的舌头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_01c691e6:



    voice "d/2RI_1501"
    rin "「呼啊……嗯嗯……亲」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a9333e3c:


    "伦舌头的动作越来越激烈。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_e19d8e4d:


    "静谧的教堂里，细小的搅拌声从未断绝。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_3400aae1:


    "伦将手指伸入了阳菜湿润的秘缝里。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c16a3887:



    voice "d/2HI_1494"
    hina "「咦——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_e78d468d:



    voice "d/2HI_1495"
    hina "「啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_aeb0e047:



    voice sustain
    "阳菜的手指刺入了伦的肩膀。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_4a73a3e9:



    voice "d/2RI_1502"
    rin "「还是老样子」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_43a8b2fb:


    "看着眼前的阳菜在轻微的爱抚下稍稍高潮，伦噗嗤地笑了出来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_ae4dce44:


    "阳菜还沉浸在余韵中，绷紧了身子，但伦却没有就此停下。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_07b6a5d0:


    "入口不断收缩。随着伦手指打转的动作，阳菜发出短促的娇声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_b447059d:



    voice "d/2HI_1496"
    hina "「啊呜……嗯嗯……咕啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a758e365:


    "只是用手指与关节在鼓起上轻轻摩擦，阳菜便会有所反应。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_43eadb27:



    voice "d/2RI_1503"
    rin "「我只是轻轻碰了下入口而已哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_d22ef099:



    voice "d/2HI_1497"
    hina "「因……因为很久……没做了嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_d9cd6732:



    voice "d/2RI_1504"
    rin "「是这样吗？我倒是觉得就算每天都做，阳菜也还是会像现在这样啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_18eeb9d9:



    voice "d/2HI_1498"
    hina "「呜呜……大概吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a083d9fd:


    "阳菜很老实地承认了。看来是理解了自己的敏感体质。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_d37c677b:



    voice "d/2RI_1505"
    rin "「今天的我可是大灰狼啊。要不要发动猛攻呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_0938be51:


    "阳菜一有感觉，伦就见缝插针。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_81cffa76:



    voice "d/2HI_1499"
    hina "「嗯……按伦喜欢的来，因为你平时做的时候总是很温柔的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c52ba60e:


    "偶尔也会被阳菜反击。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a09656f5:



    voice "d/2RI_1506"
    rin "「哦、噢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_4fdf31b3:


    "加油啊，温柔的大灰狼。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a5a39b7c:



    voice "d/2RI_1507"
    rin "「……那就按平常的来」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_77c6f639:



    voice "d/2HI_1500"
    hina "「啊……那里、不行！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_b35c0f57:


    "伦轻轻剥开珍珠上的薄皮。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_129b4c96:



    voice "d/2HI_1501"
    hina "「唔……哈啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_1210f4ce:


    "当然并不是真正意义上的不行。只是因为这是她的弱点之一。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_508bb307:



    voice "d/2RI_1508"
    rin "「有感觉的表情……喜欢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_79e5c601:



    voice "d/2HI_1502"
    hina "「嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_f81ed206:


    "阳菜把脸伸到伦眼前。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c8ca884d:



    voice "d/2RI_1509"
    rin "「这、这么欲求不满吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c90f3e91:



    voice "d/2HI_1503"
    hina "「因为你说喜欢……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_81dddcec:



    voice "d/2RI_1510"
    rin "「唔……喜欢！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_5ab9e649:


    "不断进攻的伦。在快感下咬紧牙关的阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_ce48a6ad:



    voice "d/2HI_1504"
    hina "「啊啊啊啊啊！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_104d14b7:



    voice sustain
    "阳菜的娇喘声在教堂里久久回荡。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_faf04a9b:



    voice "d/2HI_1505"
    hina "「哈啊……哈啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_12631710:


    "喘息不停的阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_059923e7:


    "她究竟高潮了几次呢？第十次之后就没数了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_7f69cdb3:



    voice "d/2RI_1511"
    rin "「手指会泡涨吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_70040561:


    "伦嘴上还在开玩笑，但也已经是上气不接下气。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_82489bb1:



    voice "d/2HI_1506"
    hina "「哈啊……手指的伤……已经好了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_107e7bff:



    voice "d/2RI_1512"
    rin "「早好了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_57c61839:



    voice "d/2HI_1507"
    hina "「这样啊……太好了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_99596c1d:


    "毕竟她一直很在意嘛。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a4d4dc39:



    voice "d/2RI_1513"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_e628eeda:


    "伦注视着阳菜的脸。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_343109f5:



    voice "d/2HI_1508"
    hina "「……什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_af3f7d36:



    voice "d/2RI_1514"
    rin "「作为和好的纪念，要添个新的伤痕吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_99358ed2:



    voice "d/2HI_1509"
    hina "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_3b87e002:



    voice "d/2RI_1515"
    rin "「咬也没关系哦。你想在哪里留下咬痕？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_889aa731:



    voice "d/2HI_1510"
    hina "「呃……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_39013047:


    "阳菜来来回回看着伦的身体。不过这个姿势下能咬到的部位也有限。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_0a42745a:



    voice "d/2HI_1511"
    hina "「这边……吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_00a89c7c:


    "大约是脖子到锁骨那一带。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_df358335:



    voice "d/2RI_1516"
    rin "「好啊。能用围巾盖住就行」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c587cc48:



    voice "d/2HI_1512"
    hina "「我、我说伦？我并不是想咬人。我……也是人哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_df11d721:


    "以咬伦为前提而进展的话题被阳菜暂时打住。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c94776d8:



    voice "d/2RI_1517"
    rin "「但我想被你咬」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_98243953:



    voice "d/2HI_1513"
    hina "「……变态？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_2ab51773:



    voice "d/2RI_1518"
    rin "「才不是！阳菜不是有项圈嘛。我也想要类似的印记」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_61957d52:


    "已经完全被称作『项圈』了啊。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_f935e59e:



    voice "d/2HI_1514"
    hina "「想要项圈的话我可以打工攒钱给你买啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_45dcf0d3:



    voice "d/2RI_1519"
    rin "「你说的是给祥子姐当模特吧？我会担心的所以不行。不如说，由阳菜给的痕迹最好。手指上的这个伤……我也挺开心的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_40ee940c:



    voice "d/2HI_1515"
    hina "「……既然伦想要的话，那我就咬了。但我会轻一点的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_7cf46752:


    "阳菜战战兢兢地将嘴唇凑向伦的脖子。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_4607e10f:



    voice "d/2HI_1516"
    hina "「啊……唔唔！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_1451e863:


    "伦再次活动起停留在阳菜身上的手指，阳菜的身体即刻有了反应。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_f3f455a5:



    voice "d/2HI_1517"
    hina "「喂……喂！要是有感觉的话……咬的力气……就控制不好了！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_7ec2f14c:



    voice "d/2RI_1520"
    rin "「不要紧的……一鼓作气咬下去」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_fedeaa2d:



    voice "d/2HI_1518"
    hina "「不行……伦、伦！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_be49ab4b:



    voice "d/2RI_1521"
    rin "「嗯……阳菜……来吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_dd14baa3:


    "忘我的阳菜点了点头，将脸埋入了伦的脖子。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_f12650a3:



    voice "d/2HI_1519"
    hina "「唔唔唔……！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_1c136afe:



    voice sustain
    "阳菜在迎来高潮的同时，牙齿抵上了伦衣领下方的皮肤。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_5b34e902:



    voice "d/2RI_1522"
    rin "「咕唔唔～～～！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_9fab9021:


    "阳菜的牙齿刺入了伦在锁骨与脖子之间的皮肤。高潮期间的阳菜无法控制自己的力度。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_074fe133:


    "被咬的伦也咬紧了牙关。或许是因为疼痛超乎了预料，她也顾不上耍嘴皮子了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_20db1ca7:



    voice "d/2HI_1520"
    hina "「嗯嗯……！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_d1eb88c5:


    "高潮持续了很久，阳菜许久没有缓过神来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_77864996:


    "她的獠牙也一直扎在伦的皮肤里。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_78e6d995:


    "自作自受——"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_03321c73:



    voice "d/2RI_1523"
    rin "「啊啊啊……唔啊啊……啊啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_5761919b:



    voice sustain
    "好像也不能这么说。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_775e6bbc:


    "伦恍惚的表情看上去很满足。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_e334babe:



    voice "d/2RI_1524"
    rin "「被……被咬的地方……好像要融化了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_3e0972ab:


    "阳菜给予的疼痛，化作酥麻的快感袭向了伦。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_eaa472f5:



    voice "d/2HI_1521"
    hina "「伦……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_8aa638ad:


    "阳菜终于有了缓过神来的迹象。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_17f32095:



    voice "d/2RI_1525"
    rin "「唔唔啊啊……！这个不妙啊……可能稍微高潮了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_7af359e2:



    voice "d/2RI_1526"
    rin "「这个……很不妙。说不定正如阳菜所说……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c1138dae:



    voice "d/2HI_1522"
    hina "「变态……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_b8aee613:



    voice "d/2HI_1523"
    hina "「哈啊……哈啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_82b3268d:


    "阳菜枕在伦的肩膀上喘着粗气。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_17147a1c:


    "伦的衣领下，阳菜的牙印清晰可见。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_7dff6d3a:


    "痕迹很明显，拉高了衣领才能勉强遮住。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_8ea17268:



    voice "d/2RI_1527"
    rin "「……此刻，你就在我怀中。我终于找到了值得相信的事物」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a0cf6278:



    voice "d/2HI_1524"
    hina "「诶，你突然说些什么呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_3608772f:



    voice "d/2RI_1528"
    rin "「这是阳菜之前吼过的歌里面的歌词」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_7a4470e4:



    voice "d/2HI_1525"
    hina "「什么时候唱的？还有不要说“吼”」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_0e9759b0:



    voice "d/2RI_1529"
    rin "「开学典礼那天晚上吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_511e0121:



    voice "d/2HI_1526"
    hina "「喵——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_b207ae6f:



    voice "d/2RI_1530"
    rin "「现在不用唱」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a5d7cd21:



    voice "d/2HI_1527"
    hina "「唔喵」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_a144404c:


    "伦竖起手指，停下了阳菜的吼叫。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_c1cf2472:



    voice "d/2HI_1528"
    hina "「原来歌词是这样的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_ce667158:



    voice "d/2RI_1531"
    rin "「此刻，我们身处天国」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_b15c5ea3:



    voice "d/2HI_1529"
    hina "「……我们也是」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene04_b734ed9a:


    "再次紧紧相拥。"
